    {
      "name": "request_account_performance_pdf_report",
      "title": "Request Account Performance PDF Report",
      "summary": "Generates a performance PDF report covering all of your account's active sites and emails it to your account email address. This is the same all-active-sites performance summary available from the Reports page. The report is generated asynchronously in the background and can take a few minutes to arrive for large accounts. No parameters are required — the report always covers the authenticated account.",
