      "summary": "Removes one or more collaborators from MANY sites in a single call — the account-wide version of remove_site_collaborators, and the offboarding counterpart to bulk_add_collaborators_to_sites. Provide emails and site_ids; use [-1] as site_ids to target every site you can manage. Optionally set delete_wp_user to also delete each person's WordPress user on each site. The change runs in the background and returns an operation_id immediately — poll get_collaborator_bulk_operation with that id to see per-site, per- collaborator results. Each removal is authorized individually, so a person you lack permission over comes back as a failed entry instead of failing the run. To remove only a specific permission rather than the whole collaborator, use bulk_revoke_collaborator_role.",
      "category": "collaborators"
