    {
      "name": "get_collaborator_bulk_operation",
      "title": "Get Collaborator Bulk Operation",
      "summary": "Shows the progress and results of a bulk collaborator operation started by bulk_add_collaborators_to_sites, bulk_remove_collaborators_from_sites, bulk_grant_collaborator_role, or bulk_revoke_collaborator_role. Provide the operation_id those tools returned. Returns roll-up counts (total, succeeded, failed, pending) plus one result row per (site, collaborator) with any error message. Results are paginated — pass status \"failed\" to see only what went wrong, which is the usual follow-up, and site_id or email to narrow further. Status is \"pending\" or \"running\" while work is still in flight and \"complete\" once every row has an outcome; poll until then.",
